--- parent disconnects first
child: parent disconnected
parent disconnects first: after disconnect() connected=false channel=null | disconnect | exit 0 null connected false
--- send after disconnect
send returns false
callback: Error ERR_IPC_CHANNEL_CLOSED Channel closed
error event: Error ERR_IPC_CHANNEL_CLOSED Channel closed
second disconnect: Error ERR_IPC_DISCONNECTED IPC channel is already disconnected
child: parent disconnected
--- a channel without listeners lets the child end
child: done without listeners
no listener: disconnect | exit 0 null | close 0 null
--- a child that sends and exits at once
send then exit (json): message "first" | message {"second":[1,2]} | disconnect | exit 5 null | close 5 null
send then exit (advanced): message "first" | message {"second":[1,2]} | disconnect | exit 5 null | close 5 null
--- exit code and kill
exit code: message "about to exit" | disconnect | exit 7 null | close 7 null
killed: message "ready" | disconnect | exit null SIGTERM | close null SIGTERM
--- silent
silent: message "sent" | disconnect | exit 0 null | close 0 null
silent stdio "to stdout\n" "to stderr\n" 4
